@baseUrl = http://localhost:5026

### Start Facebook login (follow the redirect in a browser)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/facebook?returnUrl=%2Fadvisor

### Start Facebook sign-up (creates an inactive account after OAuth completes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/facebook/register?returnUrl=%2Fadvisor

### A direct callback without the protected Facebook ticket returns 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/facebook/callback

### Reject an untrusted return URL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/facebook?returnUrl=https%3A%2F%2Fevil.example%2F
